@startuml project-creation-sequence
!theme plain
skinparam sequenceMessageAlign center
skinparam responseMessageBelowArrow true
skinparam maxMessageSize 200

title Diagrama de Secuencia: Creación de Proyecto (Caso Exitoso)
footer Archivos involucrados en el flujo

actor "Project Manager" as PM
participant "Express Router\n<<project.routes.js>>" as Router
participant "Passport JWT\n<<passport.js>>" as Auth
participant "Express Validator\n<<project.routes.js>>" as Validator
participant "ProjectController\n<<project.controller.js>>" as Controller
participant "ProjectService\n<<project.service.js>>" as Service
participant "OrganizationRepository\n<<organization.repository.js>>" as OrgRepo
participant "BaseRepository\n<<base.repository.js>>" as BaseRepo
participant "Organization Model\n<<organization.model.js>>" as OrgModel
participant "UserRepository\n<<user.repository.js>>" as UserRepo
participant "ProjectRepository\n<<project.repository.js>>" as ProjRepo
participant "Project Model\n<<project.model.js>>" as ProjModel
participant "ProjectNotificationHelper\n<<projectNotificationHelper.js>>" as NotifHelper
participant "NotificationService\n<<notification.service.js>>" as NotifService
database "MongoDB" as DB

== Autenticación y Validación ==

PM -> Router: POST /api/projects\n{organizationId, projectName, briefDescription,\nestimatedStartDate, estimatedEndDate, ...}
activate Router

Router -> Auth: authenticate('jwt', {session: false})
activate Auth
Auth -> Auth: Verificar JWT Token
Auth --> Router: req.user = {id: projectManagerId, ...}
deactivate Auth

Router -> Validator: validateProjectCreation
activate Validator
note right of Validator
  Validaciones:
  - organizationId: notEmpty, isMongoId
  - projectName: notEmpty, trim, length(2-200)
  - briefDescription: notEmpty, trim, maxLength(2000)
  - estimatedStartDate: notEmpty, isISO8601
  - estimatedEndDate: notEmpty, isISO8601
  - campos opcionales (communication, experience, etc.)
end note
Validator --> Router: validation passed
deactivate Validator

== Controlador ==

Router -> Controller: createProject(req, res)
activate Controller

Controller -> Controller: validationResult(req)
note right of Controller
  Extrae errores de validación
  (vacío en caso exitoso)
end note

Controller -> Controller: Extraer projectData, projectManagerId,\norganizationId de req.body y req.user

== Servicio de Proyecto ==

Controller -> Service: createProject(projectData,\nprojectManagerId, organizationId)
activate Service

== Validación de Organización ==

Service -> OrgRepo: findById(organizationId)
activate OrgRepo
OrgRepo -> BaseRepo: findById(organizationId)
activate BaseRepo
BaseRepo -> DB: Organization.findById(organizationId)
DB --> BaseRepo: organizationDocument
BaseRepo --> OrgRepo: organization
deactivate BaseRepo
OrgRepo --> Service: organization
deactivate OrgRepo

Service -> OrgModel: organization.isProjectManager(projectManagerId)
activate OrgModel
note right of OrgModel
  Verifica si el usuario está en
  organization.employees con
  isProjectManager = true
end note
OrgModel --> Service: true (es PM)
deactivate OrgModel

== Validación de Usuario ==

Service -> UserRepo: findById(projectManagerId)
activate UserRepo
UserRepo -> BaseRepo: findById(projectManagerId)
activate BaseRepo
BaseRepo -> DB: User.findById(projectManagerId)
DB --> BaseRepo: userDocument
BaseRepo --> UserRepo: projectManager
deactivate BaseRepo
UserRepo --> Service: projectManager
deactivate UserRepo

== Creación del Proyecto ==

Service -> ProjRepo: create({...projectData,\norganization: organizationId,\nprojectManager: projectManagerId,\nstatus: 'draft',\ncreatedAt: Date.now(),\nlastActivityAt: Date.now()})
activate ProjRepo
ProjRepo -> ProjModel: new Project(data)
activate ProjModel
ProjModel -> ProjModel: Validar schema\n(mongoose validations)
ProjModel --> ProjRepo: projectInstance
deactivate ProjModel
ProjRepo -> DB: project.save()
DB --> ProjRepo: savedProject
ProjRepo --> Service: project
deactivate ProjRepo

== Población de Relaciones ==

Service -> ProjModel: project.populate('organization', 'name')
activate ProjModel
ProjModel -> DB: Populate organization
DB --> ProjModel: populated
ProjModel --> Service: project
deactivate ProjModel

Service -> ProjModel: project.populate('projectManager',\n'name email avatar')
activate ProjModel
ProjModel -> DB: Populate projectManager
DB --> ProjModel: populated
ProjModel --> Service: project
deactivate ProjModel

Service -> ProjModel: project.populate('assignedEmployees.user',\n'name email avatar')
activate ProjModel
ProjModel -> DB: Populate assignedEmployees\n(vacío en creación)
DB --> ProjModel: populated
ProjModel --> Service: project
deactivate ProjModel

== Notificaciones ==

Service -> NotifHelper: notifyProjectCreated(project, organization)
activate NotifHelper

NotifHelper -> NotifHelper: _extractId(organization.admin)
NotifHelper -> NotifHelper: _extractId(organization.additionalAdmins[])
NotifHelper -> NotifHelper: Filtrar PM de lista de admins

loop Para cada admin (excepto PM)
    NotifHelper -> NotifService: create({\n  recipientId: adminId,\n  type: PROJECT_CREATED,\n  title: 'New project created',\n  message: 'A new project "X" has been created...',\n  channels: [IN_APP, EMAIL],\n  priority: MEDIUM,\n  metadata: {...},\n  actionUrl: '/projects/:id',\n  actionText: 'View project'\n})
    activate NotifService
    NotifService -> DB: Save notification
    DB --> NotifService: notification
    NotifService --> NotifHelper: notification
    deactivate NotifService
end

NotifHelper --> Service: notifications sent
deactivate NotifHelper

Service --> Controller: project (populated)
deactivate Service

== Respuesta ==

Controller --> Router: res.status(201).json({\n  success: true,\n  message: 'Project created successfully',\n  data: project\n})
deactivate Controller

Router --> PM: HTTP 201 Created\n{\n  success: true,\n  message: 'Project created successfully',\n  data: { _id, projectName, ... }\n}
deactivate Router

@enduml
